# M7 flow (D-107; Stage 9 "Finale and ending"): START through every phase
# of the ending at the first frame it counts, in the real stage. Title
# flow with the run started in Café Zauner (the route's last station):
# START (21), the intro, cafe_zauner_solver.replay unchanged from 171:
# the boss beaten, the goal_stollen touched in the air (2449), the Serve,
# the tally and the clear panel; the ending's Map from 2887. A press at
# 2893 is ignored (the first 30 frames of a phase); then START at the
# first allowed frame of each phase (30 frames in, 60 in the Bill and
# Ende): Map -> Scene 2917, -> Bill 2947, -> Credits 3007, page by page
# (3037, 3067, 3097, 3127, 3157), -> Ende 3187, -> the title 3247 with
# the „durchgespielt" mark; the replay ends on it (3277). The ending's
# frames follow the tally, so a new time_limit for Café Zauner moves
# every press.
level  = cafe_zauner
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
start  = title
expect = complete frames=2449..2449 deaths=0 no_event=Hurt
expect = state=title cleared=true stage=cafe_zauner score=0 lives=3 oblaten=0 power=normal
